; bal -X EUR --unrealized books no unrealized gain on a holding whose cost
; the report cannot bring to the commodity in which it values the holding.
; The euros in Assets:Euros are in the exchange commodity, but they were
; bought at a virtual cost in USD, which records no price, so -X cannot
; convert that cost to euros.  They contribute themselves to the baseline
; and add nothing to the unrealized rows, the report total is what -X
; leaves unconverted, and the report prints what it printed before the
; balance report valued postings at cost.  The AAPL lot is revalued as
; usual.  Testing only whether the report could value the euros, which -X
; does by dropping their lot annotation, booked them at their cost and
; printed an Equity:Unrealized Gains row of "-190.00 EUR / USD12.30",
; which made the report total zero only by setting the euros against the
; USD that paid for them.  Under --dc each column is tested in the same
; way.  The shape is that of regress/1936.  Under -X 'EUR,$', which names
; two commodities, the report values the AAPL lot in euros and leaves its
; dollar cost in dollars, so a baseline at cost booked no gain on the lot
; and printed no unrealized row; the report keeps the revaluation between
; postings instead and books the -180.00 EUR it booked before.

P 2024/01/01 $ EUR0.90

2024/01/10 Buy euros at a virtual cost in USD
    Assets:Euros            10.00 EUR {1.23 USD} (@) 1.23 USD
    Assets:Bank

2024/02/01 Buy shares
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL @ $150
    Assets:Checking

P 2024/03/01 AAPL $170

test bal -X EUR --unrealized --now 2024/04/01
          190.00 EUR
           USD-12.30  Assets
           USD-12.30    Bank
         1530.00 EUR    Brokerage
        -1350.00 EUR    Checking
           10.00 EUR    Euros
         -180.00 EUR  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
           10.00 EUR
           USD-12.30
end test

test bal -X EUR --unrealized --dc --now 2024/04/01
   1540.00 EUR    1350.00 EUR
                   USD12.30     190.00 EUR
                               USD-12.30  Assets
             0       USD12.30      USD-12.30    Bank
   1530.00 EUR              0    1530.00 EUR    Brokerage
             0    1350.00 EUR   -1350.00 EUR    Checking
     10.00 EUR              0      10.00 EUR    Euros
    180.00 EUR              0    -180.00 EUR  Equity:Unrealized Gains
-------------- -------------- --------------
   1360.00 EUR    1350.00 EUR
                   USD12.30      10.00 EUR
                               USD-12.30
end test

test bal -X 'EUR,$' --unrealized --now 2024/04/01
              $-1500
         1540.00 EUR
           USD-12.30  Assets
           USD-12.30    Bank
         1530.00 EUR    Brokerage
              $-1500    Checking
           10.00 EUR    Euros
         -180.00 EUR  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
              $-1500
         1360.00 EUR
           USD-12.30
end test
